      "description": "ANO2 drives its own entry in the lumped peroxy pool. CBM-Z writes reactions {127:107}..{136:116} pseudo-first-order, so ten of its rate COEFFICIENTS read the peroxy concentrations; this is the edge that closes that loop."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
